"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">洗濯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">せんたく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">洗衣；洗涤；放松；消除（忧虑、疲劳等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141216\"><ruby>洗濯<rp>(</rp><rt>せんたく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつやってもいいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我什么时候可以洗衣服?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">セーター</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">毛衣；套头衫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223610\">このセーターは<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我不喜欢这个塞特。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ゼロ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">零；0；无；无；一无所有；毫无</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"165629\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>商売<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうばい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をゼロから<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めなければならなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们必须从零开始做生意。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">全部</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぜんぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"